<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>GHSS Panamaram • Kalolsavam 2026</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#170c24; --card:rgba(35,18,55,.88); --card2:rgba(54,23,65,.88); --text:#fffaf2;
  --muted:#dfcfe4; --gold:#ffd166; --green:#56e39a; --red:#ff6682;
  --blue:#65b5ff; --yellow:#f5d76e; --border:rgba(255,255,255,.16);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box} html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--text);
background:
radial-gradient(circle at 12% 18%,rgba(255,99,132,.28),transparent 22%),
radial-gradient(circle at 86% 12%,rgba(255,209,102,.25),transparent 20%),
radial-gradient(circle at 75% 78%,rgba(83,177,255,.20),transparent 24%),
linear-gradient(145deg,#12071d,#241033 48%,#10091b);position:relative;overflow-x:hidden}
body:before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:.22;
background-image:
radial-gradient(circle at 20% 35%,#ffd166 0 2px,transparent 3px),
radial-gradient(circle at 80% 55%,#ff6682 0 2px,transparent 3px),
radial-gradient(circle at 45% 80%,#65b5ff 0 2px,transparent 3px);
background-size:90px 90px,130px 130px,160px 160px;z-index:-1}
body:after{content:"🎭   💃   🎶   🪘   🎨   🎤   ✨   🕺   🎻   🥁";
position:fixed;inset:auto -40px 8px -40px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:22px;
opacity:.09;transform:rotate(-3deg);pointer-events:none;z-index:-1}
header{min-height:460px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:50px 20px;
position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:
linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(8,3,15,.12),rgba(8,3,15,.62)),
radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%,rgba(255,209,102,.30),transparent 30%)}
header:before{content:"KATHAKALI   •   MOHINIYATTAM   •   MUSIC   •   DANCE   •   DRAMA";
position:absolute;top:25px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;color:#ffd166;opacity:.18;
font-size:13px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:5px}
header:after{content:"🎭  💃  🎶  🪘  🎨  🎤  🕺  🎻  🥁";
position:absolute;bottom:24px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:12px;
opacity:.28;filter:drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.6))}
.hero{max-width:1050px;position:relative;z-index:2}
.badge{display:inline-block;padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid rgba(255,209,102,.4);border-radius:999px;color:var(--gold);background:rgba(255,209,102,.08);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px}
h1{font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,88px);line-height:.95;margin:20px 0 12px;letter-spacing:-3px}
.hero p{font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,21px);color:var(--muted);margin:0 auto 25px;max-width:760px}
.hero .buttons{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;color:#07111f;background:var(--gold);padding:12px 20px;border-radius:14px;font-weight:800}
.btn.alt{background:transparent;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border)}
.container{width:min(1180px,92%);margin:auto}
section{padding:55px 0}
.section-title{font-size:34px;margin:0 0 8px}.section-sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 25px}
.score-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}
.score{padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--card),var(--card2));position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.score strong{font-size:38px;display:block}.score span{color:var(--muted)}
.score.first{outline:2px solid rgba(57,217,138,.55)}
.crown{position:absolute;right:15px;top:12px;font-size:26px}
.controls{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:25px 0}
.filter,.search{background:var(--card);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:13px;font-size:15px}
.filter{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}.filter.active{background:var(--gold);color:#07111f}
.search{flex:1;min-width:230px;outline:none}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(35,18,55,.94),rgba(53,24,67,.94));border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:20px;transition:.2s;cursor:pointer}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:rgba(255,209,102,.45)}
.tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(85,167,255,.12);color:#9dccff}
.tag.done{background:rgba(57,217,138,.12);color:#7df0b3}.tag.up{background:rgba(255,209,102,.1);color:var(--gold)}
.card h3{margin:14px 0 7px;font-size:20px}.card p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.winner{margin-top:15px;padding:12px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(57,217,138,.08);border:1px solid rgba(57,217,138,.15)}
.winner b{color:#8af2bd}.winner small{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}
.details{margin-top:30px;padding:24px;border-radius:22px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--border);display:none}
.details.show{display:block}.details h3{margin-top:0}.podium{display:grid;gap:9px;margin-top:15px}
.person{padding:12px 14px;border-radius:13px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}
.person span{color:var(--muted)}
.note{padding:16px;border-left:4px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(255,209,102,.06);color:#dce8f4;border-radius:10px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:35px 15px;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
@media(max-width:850px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.score-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(max-width:560px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.score-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}h1{letter-spacing:-1.5px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="badge">🎭 SCHOOL KALOLSAVAM 2026</div>
    <h1>GHSS PANAMARAM</h1>
    <p>കലയുടെ നിറങ്ങളും കഴിവുകളുടെ വേദിയും — On Stage & Off Stage പരിപാടികളുടെ നിലവിലെ ഫലം</p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <a class="btn" href="#programs">View Programs</a>
      <a class="btn alt" href="#score">View House Score</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section id="score">
<div class="container">
  <h2 class="section-title">🏆 Current House Score</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Uploaded result sheet-ൽ നൽകിയിരിക്കുന്ന നിലവിലെ total points അടിസ്ഥാനമാക്കി.</p>
  <div class="score-grid">
    <div class="score first"><div class="crown">👑</div><strong>57</strong><span>GREEN • 1st</span></div>
    <div class="score"><strong>41</strong><span>RED • 2nd</span></div>
    <div class="score"><strong>33</strong><span>BLUE • 3rd</span></div>
    <div class="score"><strong>32</strong><span>YELLOW • 4th</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="programs">
<div class="container">
  <h2 class="section-title">🎨 Programs</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Completed items-ന് നിലവിലെ result details; remaining items-ന് program name മാത്രം.</p>
  <div class="controls">
    <button class="filter active" data-filter="all">All</button>
    <button class="filter" data-filter="done">✅ Completed</button>
    <button class="filter" data-filter="up">⏳ Upcoming</button>
    <input id="search" class="search" placeholder="🔎 Search program..." />
  </div>
  <div id="grid" class="grid"></div>
  <div id="details" class="details"></div>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="container">
  <h2 class="section-title">🥇🥈🥉 Current Group Ranking</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">ഇപ്പോൾ ലഭ്യമായ score sheet-ലെ group total points പ്രകാരം.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card"><span class="tag done">🥇 1st GROUP</span><h3>GREEN</h3><p><strong style="font-size:30px;color:var(--green)">57 points</strong></p></div>
    <div class="card"><span class="tag">🥈 2nd GROUP</span><h3>RED</h3><p><strong style="font-size:30px;color:var(--red)">41 points</strong></p></div>
    <div class="card"><span class="tag">🥉 3rd GROUP</span><h3>BLUE</h3><p><strong style="font-size:30px;color:var(--blue)">33 points</strong></p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="note" style="margin-top:15px">4th: YELLOW — 32 points. ഈ ranking നിലവിലെ uploaded score sheet മാത്രം അടിസ്ഥാനമാക്കിയതാണ്.</div>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="container">
  <h2 class="section-title">📌 Participation Rule</h2>
  <div class="note">ഒരു കുട്ടിക്ക് സ്റ്റേജ് ഇനങ്ങളും ഓഫ് സ്റ്റേജ് ഇനങ്ങളും ഉൾപ്പെടെ 3 വ്യക്തിഗത ഇനങ്ങളിലും 2 ഗ്രൂപ്പ് ഇനങ്ങളിലും പങ്കെടുക്കാം.</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div>🎭 GHSS Panamaram • School Kalolsavam 2026</div>
  <div style="margin-top:8px">Made for the school arts festival • <b>Little Kites Student</b></div>
</footer>

